          }
          comment {
            value: "It is strongly recommended that this element be populated using a terminology, where possible. For example, some terminologies used include RxNorm, SNOMED CT, DM+D, NDFRT, UNII, and ATC. Plain text should only be used if there is no appropriate terminology available. Additional details can be specified in the text."
